{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fcf75292fe9ec092b516c40bb34852e8a82d182c1d23d5d99fe81a6b3e317d12",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8dcf134bb64bb95d546fe17396c5545463ddb9d468c044f252710367aaeb7574",
      "text": "以心换心",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41cc32f110c9b45d9486c9295b7cce0a670fa2c42131fb594b46153a164c91e2",
      "text": "制作人被辉带去了\n他常去的裁缝铺。\n为了定制新西装，\n制作人向辉请教了关于定制西装的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8dcf134bb64bb95d546fe17396c5545463ddb9d468c044f252710367aaeb7574",
      "text": "以心换心",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_a:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aba64ec13d128a788dcc94bf64351fa7b3d75a4fd60566d9d7632939a0023c91",
      "text": "裁缝铺",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5420f405e04f6550b4432d4e3897d4d0417f1394809a79cab7a6747e39be35b",
      "text": "你好～。咦，老板？老爷子——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bba5eb75fde938744f32b17c72f8765d54e4cc6588034707896cda0749c2f89",
      "text": "没有回应呢，是不在吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5b7cc3e87f73d15eefc24d8ec93510e8027a14c7747a2a883feace4d3f865a0",
      "text": "也有可能是在里面专心干活吧。\n在老板出来前，先在店里随便看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_a:cmd-000047:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ec4f5b49c2fd29076423c490c38133f9baa02929f320ff40ee5e5c3d6b63ddd",
      "text": "……呐，●●●●プロデューサー。店不错吧？\n这里是我做律师时就经常光顾的店。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd71cafc96b2832eef99499c5eabcb0b8af94fe6a2b68da4dfd5e8ebcecb6913",
      "text": "是啊，店里的氛围很温馨，\n让人宾至如归。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee89016ba84342e2d8de87faf2243fdf7e2a9573ea45dddc68ee4090c8021032",
      "text": "谢谢你向我介绍这么棒的店。\n多亏了你帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f22df10dcaef36af17cbeb1352481343f081c4d3d5762c48e7efd133e810181b",
      "text": "嘿嘿，不用客气啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d43994918dd9482f5dd08efd690eee45c9621e97add87788cdc78f71f155ca9d",
      "text": "听你说“正在找做新西装的店”时，\n我马上就想到这里了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef7354a058c8625fbba79e9f877232a21abde76dc13f7013db1e95228affc1e5",
      "text": "因为我早就想带你来一次了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_a:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71ede69d4d3cf08805a548daf2099f5657fdc518e18f107fa0723968f86566f5",
      "text": "不过一到店里，自己也想要了啊……\n难得来一趟，我也定做一套吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_a:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14dfa082bd34d5935f2c4adbac6a9772d26d12385838248bbc503ec7c13209e5",
      "text": "嘛，定制方面要是有什么不懂的，\n随时问我啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5eacecb53ad2dccf7cc7ef17375d3362be3ffd306422df1ae345bd268c586a8",
      "text": "谢谢。辉先生平时\n都是怎么定制的呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64f8927df8ac5d0666e5bafa32c0bbd0dadac7500e1150dd8d963c287e554e6e",
      "text": "这个嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e7d1a76b37661f4f787385d5424c64db7fb68f26c17a185401018410a9b3610",
      "text": "打算在什么场合穿。\n想用什么面料做……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54f8ca4e0086fd6f1b80919d1f7e0088c9b3035df327a7937f7ef94fe78d13f6",
      "text": "先从这些必不可少的要点考虑，\n然后再决定细节部分吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c38fd40d28158d85f08f5686d84b99e495d64ba2f106861b0c0f6988560e804",
      "text": "要是有纠结的地方就咨询老板。\n无论什么问题他都会给出最佳答案的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8510ecd2c52f2097b67f4a426c9f7138ad8c40d018df5c56baa1bc9a7e8662a",
      "text": "是的。无论是什么需求，\n我都会为顾客提供最合适的建议。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3baf11f3c763bbbeae99d292db2eab67c56174d17d52adf7cd1801a56eb12c1d",
      "text": "刚才在里面干活，没能及时注意到。\n实在抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f440c2c2a4f8dd33bda991238553bf807e276d885dc83db014e250d8e79be40a",
      "text": "喔，老爷子！\n给你介绍一下，这位是这家店的老板。然后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe5d35b7b840eb07767d989723d821622ebc73a9e3848bc078f321f02061509f",
      "text": "老爷子，这位是我的制作人。\n今天我们俩一起来做西装的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6a9c68569c58bc4fa245261719d88926d42ea88fe52f56e0493ba11cf47526b",
      "text": "初次见面。久闻大名了，辉先生经常提起您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec46f0f0628543bbb2126ee2a75b212f562fbe81e1ca2d3fbe46b6f39c6aba54",
      "text": "今天请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb3c8ce5b2b3f414860e09077aae8e55ee793e5ff11ce734a0df8d6783a42c34",
      "text": "……看吧，老爷子。\n制作人和我说的完全一样吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d289218816bb6cc2d012fb32c165b71f5a95d856f2a36a231eb9b36c33024632",
      "text": "自从偶像出道后，\n每次来这店里我都会提起你呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d3e35ba710ce9801cecd7b1a6e08699a150f8e6b27c95e18f571c4fe8cda250",
      "text": "说你总是为了我们拼命努力，\n是个靠得住的好伙伴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f814bd29081f35107370fa23413eb47001f5969ad9776cb8a2503077902a056",
      "text": "确实正如辉先生所言呢。\n给您做西装可真让人充满干劲啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ef22c14938350fb10b5edb5cd7d6ec828963a73ab42e88cd177c35a3755531f",
      "text": "制作人，先来选面料吧！\n老爷子，有面料样册吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09f49e33d1e45c4e248b3a4ff36385d47703ca4eb7e4fe21bf82e3f508472e5a",
      "text": "好的，在这里。也有新款的面料哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10ee8390aa4f721567415e06cac7f32186e3cc632f703da014b4f39df52dea84",
      "text": "那可真让人期待！我来看看……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f9f5c6e17a99331b73c9a19a00a7ce48173b54d7ee74319f4efba60def9a528",
      "text": "噢噢，这个颜色不是挺好的吗？\n觉得怎么样，●●●●プロデューサー？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:334aa503ec90e7562ae8005311a4371810708e1f2af5a397843114811e35cad5",
      "text": "居然有这么多！光是选颜色都要纠结了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8bc3d66a12bfac79509428a31613160601883d81ba1cc8e5400978de3578c40",
      "text": "不光是颜色和花纹，按手感来挑也是一种方法哦。\n产地不同特征也不一样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d904eb9ce7e961f4453b556e3ad47c9ffaf162d6d0d9a4ade600b87afd63fda",
      "text": "本店可以满足您的任何需求。\n面料和款式都可以慢慢考虑哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6832f40c127261e4c15fca03caf0d88c7399f409017088cf3f4435a315b5648",
      "text": "对了。除了西装，\n顺便配点小饰品也不错呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00f51bb5dff84de1f2ac1134ded88dd98763d1db5be9f609307880e2d08b5eb6",
      "text": "我的这条丝巾，\n也是在这里挑的跟西装搭配的款式。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:534cbaf9c08b05b968fe96914698726c9ee3550665fe00d0a0243441e5ee820a",
      "text": "多亏了这个，整套穿搭\n显得特别干练对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:303d25576373fe7e50b56d016d62559cce8def50adde2fa302ddc1c84168007b",
      "text": "是啊！无论是西装还是丝巾，\n都非常契合辉先生的气质呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2edcfc3dde2efcf00d368c5946ea05a316779b8afef68ee0f5cad4fb014218b",
      "text": "对吧？等西装定下概念后，\n我们也去看看配饰吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_d:cmd-000040:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7da8155bf3814e0baf2870281f349fb06f4d56e2a96c21ced243d97e7bbcfb1",
      "text": "辛苦啦！量身也结束了，\n接下来只要交给老爷子的手艺就行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57c0a527bfd9d9d17d3835f728f3db94228e45821e1d98cce29becc07e4e568d",
      "text": "成品虽然很让人期待，但和两位一边讨论一边定做的过程\n也非常愉快。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbd1fedf1e3453b4077d4869f82ca97be54640ec50ba90e3f9691be1e124fb36",
      "text": "彼此彼此啦。一直关注着我作为偶像那一面的你提出的意见，\n很有参考价值哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9473b86ce0ca6850b7659c1b5981ced6691255769ba55e9b0199966036247e93",
      "text": "那，老爷子。结账吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f82592cd978292891e81d9b7baae227961c5faba56dd2f8d8dbe3bee5974458",
      "text": "费用就免了。……这两套，\n就当是我送给二位的礼物吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a056ee1720f5a730b4209cab657cf7f30f09a68ea64d0873fb310af9121046a",
      "text": "你在说什么啊！\n这种事情还是要公私分明的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed5bd8ea3a64f673480c139b5b468c517f0f2b9e13cce62af4abef73f56a091e",
      "text": "不，我一直想为辉先生\n成为偶像送一份贺礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef3f488485f071250ff46aa63726d2115b4c837e11c723503301e91672121804",
      "text": "而且我也希望制作人今后能继续\n和辉先生一起加油。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a9263f1dbe0dc073999dd34e18720eb0cc063945d5bfdfd8e619f7bdfd84307",
      "text": "请收下我为二位送上的\n这份心意与应援吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bb88e9257b81624e30f97eaeb3df76c7caf3d3a9e80a08e932fbbb653433300",
      "text": "老爷子……好吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae6987c9c7a41d3fb7270ce1183cf44cfdc2540a1c6d79d551d98e61fafa65c3",
      "text": "既然这样，那我们就恭敬不如从命了。\n……谢谢你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57d629f6ab55439a684fca7a4eeaf11a5b93ecb08f58d76ae689cc1d8b0e403c",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。穿上老爷子做的\n西装，我们就如虎添翼了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e313cb77af9990ff01403b9ba4d42b0386aee4264f314de3818a2054b0feae6b",
      "text": "是啊。无论发生什么，我都会全力支持辉先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:059005dffc1eded9d8df986bbbc05810b3add8db0afffdd1a07c711355050249",
      "text": "我也会用不输给你的制作力量\n来全力回应你的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0fc759f18c6051b52802ab6695f9b8907686348d7c998f99d291c8b9568d062",
      "text": "做好了之后，再一起过来取吧。\n真期待穿上的那一天啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
